3进1，则兵三进一，炮1退2（卒7进1，车二平三，马3退5，马三进四，红方占优），马八进九，黑子力受制，红优。","text":"    红弃七兵，以强有力的手段突破黑的防线，是意味深长的一着棋。黑炮再击三兵意在积极对攻，如改走卒3进1，则兵三进一，炮1退2（卒7进1，车二平三，马3退5，马三进四，红方占优），马八进九，黑子力受制，红优。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"0:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment29:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment29","raw_text":"    黑方炮卒难掀大浪，红方放胆弃马，挺中兵由中路突破，着法犀利明快，以下红正面攻势一浪高过一浪，终成不可阻挡的洪流。","text":"    黑方炮卒难掀大浪，红方放胆弃马，挺中兵由中路突破，着法犀利明快，以下红正面攻势一浪高过一浪，终成不可阻挡的洪流。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":29,"anchor_node_id":"0:29","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment37:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment37","raw_text":"    左马出击，如虎添翼。","text":"    左马出击，如虎添翼。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":37,"anchor_node_id":"0:37","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment49:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment49","raw_text":"    ||","text":"    \n","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":49,"anchor_node_id":"0:49","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["103浙江陈孝堃 先胜 上海邬正伟"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第三章 中炮对其它（26局）"],"DhtmlXQ_table":[""],"DhtmlXQ_red":[" "],"DhtmlXQ_redteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_black":[" "],"DhtmlXQ_blackteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blackrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_result":["未知"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["B04 中炮对右三步虎"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"],"DhtmlXQ_type":["实战全局/开局"]},"source_tag_count":22,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":49,"legal_move_records":49,"annotations":5,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":5}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-66","category_id":"6